  "fullDescription": "Thursday Christmas (Display, Bold Rounded Holiday)\n\nThursday Christmas is a joyfully bold and plump display font specifically designed to capture the festive, friendly, and colorful spirit of the holiday season, making every headline a celebration.\n\nThis charming Thursday Christmas typeface features extra-thick, rounded letterforms that are easy to read and perfect for applying fun holiday colors and effects. Its simple, chunky style gives it a classic, wholesome holiday appeal.\n\nThis delightful Thursday Christmas font is essential for all seasonal design projects, including holiday sales promotions, festive greeting cards, children’s Christmas crafts, and retail signage. As a versatile display font, it is a bold, warm, and highly effective tool for delivering a clear, cheerful holiday message",
